                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Only recommended for player's willing to tinker a little. \n\n1.  Run the game first so that it creates files required for step 3.  Close the game\n\n2. This fixes many things, the site has instructions at the bottom.  Step 3 on the doareborn website is not mandatory.  This restores Online Lobbies and includes Rollback Netcode (Rollback only works in Lobby matches according to the websites FAQ) - https://doareborn.com/\n\n3. Fix online functionality with this https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2800936441\n\n4. Play and enjoy!\n\nOptional - Visit https://www.freestepdodge.com/ \nScroll to the bottom of the page and click on the Discord icon for an invite to freestepdodge DOA community, most likely the biggest DOA community on Discord.  From there you can use the matchmaking and discuss all things DOA.\n\n\n\n",
